<h1>Your trial has ended</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @user.name.presence || @user.email %>,</p>

<p>
  Your StudioFlow <strong><%= @tier_label %></strong> trial period has ended and
  your account has been moved to the <strong>Starter</strong> (free) plan.
</p>

<p>
  You haven't lost any of your data — it's all still there waiting for you.
  Upgrading will immediately restore access to all your premium features.
</p>

<a href="<%= @billing_url %>" class="btn">Upgrade your plan</a>

<% content_for :footer do %>
  You received this email because your StudioFlow trial has ended.
<% end %>
